# Help: Kernel support for an NVIDIA GPU passed through to the guest
#
# NVIDIA's open GPU kernel modules build out of tree against this kernel:
# nvidia exports dma-bufs and nvidia-uvm imports them (DMA_SHARED_BUFFER,
# which has no prompt and DRM selects), and nvidia-drm needs DRM itself.
# The PCI device arrives over VFIO from the host and nvidia binds it.
# See: https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules
CONFIG_DRM=m
